    "Id": "vehicledef_VISOR_A",
    "Name": "Visor A",
    "Details": "The A configuration of the Visor Strike Vehicle mounts a Clan LRM-15 with an Artemis V attachment in the turret and a Clan Large Pulse Laser in the front. This loadout is meant to provide accurate fire support while limiting the damage caused by stray fire. As with every Visor, the weapons stay hidden behind the bodywork of a civilian Puller truck until the crew reveals them.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         110     20\n<b>Right</b>       110     20\n<b>Rear</b>        110     20\n<b>Turret</b>      110     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      595    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>",
